    },
    {
        "source": "Out of the 20 most popular Alternate Universe tags — where the setting itself, not just the characters, diverges from canon — nearly half are set in everyday circumstances like \"high school\" and \"coffee shops\" or transform extraordinary characters into \"humans\" with \"no powers\".",
        "why": "The file contains no tag data."
