    },
    {
        "source": "Ship fanfics about YouTube vloggers and video gamers overtook One Directioner fics in 2021.",
        "why": "No RPF fandom data and no 2021 data are present in the file."
    },
    {
        "source": "BTS skyrocketed into the top spot in 2019. In 2024, there were close to 350,000 BTS fanfic works with ships, over 4 times more than One Direction.",
        "why": "The file contains no BTS or One Direction RPF ship rows and no multi-year fandom totals."
    },
    {
        "source": "41% are slash ships (M/M) and 23% are XReader ships, where the author inserts themselves in the storyline.",
        "why": "The BTS relationship breakdown cannot be computed from the file, which has no BTS ships or XReader/other relationship categories."
