        "why": "The file has no YouTube RPF ships of all relationship types (its three YouTube RPF rows are M/M only), so the Gen and M/M shares cannot be computed."
    },
    {
        "source": "Looking at Top 5 RPF ships by relationship type, we can see that 4 out of 5 straight ships are canon",
        "why": "The file has no RPF ships and no F/M ships."
    },
    {
        "source": "Conversely, the Top 5 ships for M/M and F/F are nearly all non-canon, with the exception of femslash soccer pairing Tobin Heath/Christen Press",
        "why": "The RPF top-5 chart cannot be reproduced because the file contains no RPF ships, and it has no F/F ships."
    },
    {
        "source": "Only 3.9% of top 1,000 solo music artists self-identify as members of the LGBTQ+ community, but 9.8% of millennials and a whopping 22.3% of Gen Zers do.",
